  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "Let me analyze the data more carefully. The validation accuracy at the end is 0.8768, which is outside the expected healthy range of approximately 0.8519-0.8607. The run is achieving higher accuracy than expected. Let me examine if there are any configuration issues that might explain this anomaly:",
