   }
  },
  {
   "turn": 6,
   "response_text": "The final validation accuracy is 0.876751, which is clearly outside the healthy range of 0.8519-0.8607. This is approximately 1.6-2.7% above the expected healthy performance.\n\nThe root cause is the `opt_c: true` configuration parameter that adds an artificial derived column with a strong signal about the labels. This is a data contamination/information leakage issue.\n\nThe correct fix is to set `opt_c: false` to disable the addition of the derived column.",
